      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've only come across one nuisance ranked person in my 700+ hours, and what they did was joined the public world, send friend requests to everyone, and proceeded to use their avatar to be loud, noisy, obnoxious, shader ball spam, etc.\nIt seems to me that typically, you have to be doing a LOT to earn that rank. (Just from the sheer rareness, and the behavior of the one I encountered)",
