  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-02-12T06:54:45.795Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Instead of stripping away nuisance players from having any fun by automatically hiding their avatars, being muted and disabling their ability to upload avatars/worlds, let other users in the world know that they have the nuisance rank. The other users then can choose to hide their avatars, mute, or block them. Additionally, adding another safety rank that is dedicated to nuisance ranks. I think it's really unfair to be put into nuisance rank for being blocked by many people. I tell people to block and/or hide my avatar when I show people things I would make in Unity. Many people tell me they like what I make and tend to send me friend requests because of it. On the other hand, I didn't know being blocked enough would revoke my access to essentially do anything fun in the game anymore. Now that I'm a nuisance rank, I immediately get blocked by random people for doing or saying literally nothing. Also getting ridiculed for it makes the game frustrating to even be on because it's almost as if you don't exist while having the nuisance rank. This should really be changed in my opinion.",
